<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said it downgraded Gadzooks Inc to market perform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said the stock was downgraded during the day on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wednesday afternoon, Gadzooks said it expects sales and earnings for the second quarter to fall short of analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>-- Gadzooks gained 1-1/8 to 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
